# Flat L4 atom sheet. Not a hierarchy. Fill more later.
# attr|role|note
quanta|unit|base unit of physical matter (structured data)
mass|energy-to-move|macro motion or binding force scale
charge|field|codeterminant of attract
polarity|orientation|codeterminant of bind
reactivity|rate|how fast merge/split
excitability|threshold|melting/boiling unknown-property sit
melting_point|threshold|phase solid→liquid, unknown d
boiling_point|threshold|phase liquid→gas
binding|attract|codeterminant mass+charge+excitability
phase|structure|gas|liquid|solid = volume-freedom
volume_freedom|motion|high gas, mid liquid, low solid
temperature|energy|subset of entropy + unknown
entropy|disorder|noise/energy spread
energy|capacity|related to mass and temperature
attract|merge-attach|leads to antiderivative (molecule, not new R5)
